&lt;h5 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(ⅳ) リース料債権の満期分析&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:18pt;"&gt;(単位：百万円)&lt;/p&gt;
